---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About Lérins AI">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 px-4 py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg sm:p-12">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">About the product</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-blue-700">About This Plugin</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-700"><strong class="text-blue-600">Lérins AI</strong> is a plugin developed to help businesses and creators easily collect valuable feedback from their customers. Our goal is to empower you to make data-driven improvements and deliver a better user experience.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-600">Why is Feedback Important?</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-slate-700">
        <li><strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong> Feedback highlights what works and what needs attention, guiding your product’s evolution.</li>
        <li><strong>Customer Satisfaction:</strong> Listening to your users shows you care, building trust and loyalty.</li>
        <li><strong>Innovation:</strong> New ideas and perspectives often come directly from your customers.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-600">Ongoing Project</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">This plugin is an ongoing project, and we are committed to making it better with every update. Your feedback is at the heart of our development process.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400 bg-blue-50 p-4 font-semibold text-blue-800">We love hearing from you! If you have suggestions, questions, or ideas, please let us know. Together, we can create the best feedback tool for everyone.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
